<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore August M1 rises 6.4 percent year on year.</title>
<headline>Singapore August M1 rises 6.4 percent year on year.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Money supply figures.</p>
<p>	   (in billions of Singapore dollars)</p>
<p>				  Aug	July	 Aug 95</p>
<p>M-1 (narrow money)	 26.07     26.20	24.49</p>
<p>M-2			   109.10     108.80     97.91</p>
<p>M-3 (broad money)	 135.95     135.82    123.47</p>
<p>Demand deposits	    16.13	16.33     14.98</p>
<p>Currency in active	  9.94	 9.87	9.51</p>
<p>circulation</p>
<p>Note - The Monetary Authority of Singapore (MAS) said growth of all monetary aggregates moderated in August.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
